msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Philips - CDi (SAME CDi)"
msgstr "Philips - CDi (SAME CDi)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "SAME_CDI is a libretro core to play CD-i games. This is a fork and modification of the MAME libretro core."
msgstr "SAME_CDI je jádro Libretro pro hraní her CD-i. Jedná se o fork a úpravu jádra MAME pro Libretro."

